  <!-- ELA_3 · Present Continuous -->
  <div class="card" id="ela3">
    <div class="card-header">
      <div class="card-icon blue">▶️</div>
      <div>
        <div class="card-title">ELA 3 · Present Continuous</div>
        <div class="card-sub">Unit 1 · Building a Classroom Community</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="def-box">
      <div class="label">📌 Definição</div>
      <p>The Present Continuous is used to talk about things happening <strong>NOW</strong>, at this exact moment.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="formula">Subject + <b>am / is / are</b> + verb + <b>-ING</b></div>

    <div class="pt-tip">🇧🇷 Em português: corresponde ao gerúndio — "Eu <b>estou lendo</b>", "Ela <b>está escrevendo</b>".</div>

    <div class="tbl-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Subject</th><th>To Be</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>I</td><td><b>am</b></td><td>I <b>am reading</b> a book.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>He / She / It</td><td><b>is</b></td><td>She <b>is writing</b> a paragraph.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>You / We / They</td><td><b>are</b></td><td>They <b>are playing</b> soccer.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="tbl-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Regra para -ING</th><th>Exemplo</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Most verbs: add -ing</td><td>play → <b>playing</b>, read → <b>reading</b></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Ends in -e: remove -e + ing</td><td>write → <b>writing</b>, ride → <b>riding</b></td></tr>
          <tr><td>CVC short verb: double last consonant</td><td>run → <b>running</b>, sit → <b>sitting</b></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="memory-box">
      <div class="emoji">🧠</div>
      <div>
        <strong>Dica CVC</strong>
        <p>CVC = Consoante + Vogal + Consoante. Ex: r-u-n. Se termina nesse padrão e é curto → dobra a última letra! <b>run→running</b>, <b>sit→sitting</b>, <b>swim→swimming</b>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quiz-section">
      <h3>🎯 Quiz — Present Continuous</h3>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="b">
        <p>1. What is the correct structure for <b>Present Continuous</b>?</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) Subject + verb + ed</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) Subject + am/is/are + verb + ing</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="c">c) Subject + had + past participle</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="d">d) Subject + will + verb</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-fb">✅ <b>am/is/are + verb-ing</b>!</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="c">
        <p>2. Which sentence is in <b>Present Continuous</b>?</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) She reads every day.</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) She was reading yesterday.</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="c">c) She is reading right now.</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="d">d) She read a book last week.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-fb">✅ <b>She is reading right now</b> — "right now" indica o momento presente!</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="c">
        <p>3. What is the correct <b>-ING</b> form of "write"?</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) writeing</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) writting</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="c">c) writing</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="d">d) writ</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-fb">✅ write termina em -e → remove o -e → <b>writing</b>!</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="b">
        <p>4. Complete: "They _____ soccer right now."</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) plays</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) are playing</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="c">c) played</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="d">d) is playing</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-fb">✅ They → <b>are playing</b>!</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="a">
        <p>5. What is the correct -ING form of "run"?</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) running</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) runing</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="c">c) runned</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="d">d) runs</div>
