  <!-- ELA_5 · Linking Verbs -->
  <div class="card" id="ela5">
    <div class="card-header">
      <div class="card-icon pink">🔗</div>
      <div>
        <div class="card-title">ELA 5 · Linking Verbs</div>
        <div class="card-sub">Unit 2 · Establishing the Writing Process</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="def-box">
      <div class="label">📌 Definição</div>
      <p>Linking verbs do <strong>NOT show action</strong>. They <strong>CONNECT (link)</strong> the subject to more information — usually an adjective or a noun.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="compare-grid">
      <div class="compare-card a">
        <strong>⚡ Action Verb</strong>
        <span>She <b>RUNS</b> every day.<br><i>(shows action)</i></span>
      </div>
      <div class="compare-card b">
        <strong>🔗 Linking Verb</strong>
        <span>She <b>IS</b> happy.<br><i>(connects to adjective)</i></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style="font-weight:800;color:var(--blue-700);margin:.8rem 0 .4rem;font-size:.95rem;">Common Linking Verbs:</p>
    <div>
      <span class="pill pill-blue">am</span><span class="pill pill-blue">is</span><span class="pill pill-blue">are</span>
      <span class="pill pill-blue">was</span><span class="pill pill-blue">were</span>
      <span class="pill pill-purple">seem</span><span class="pill pill-purple">become</span>
      <span class="pill pill-green">feel</span><span class="pill pill-green">look</span>
      <span class="pill pill-orange">smell</span><span class="pill pill-orange">taste</span>
      <span class="pill pill-pink">sound</span>
    </div>

    <ul class="examples" style="margin-top:.9rem">
      <li>Peter <b>is</b> frustrated because his brother Fudge <b>is</b> very naughty.</li>
      <li>Fudge <b>is</b> a funny boy, but he <b>is</b> very messy.</li>
      <li>Peter <b>feels</b> angry when Fudge is in his room.</li>
      <li>Fudge <b>becomes</b> quiet when he <b>is</b> sleepy.</li>
      <li>The soup <b>smells</b> wonderful.</li>
      <li>The flowers <b>look</b> beautiful.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="quiz-section">
      <h3>🎯 Quiz — Linking Verbs</h3>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="c">
        <p>1. Which of the following is a <b>Linking Verb</b>?</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) run</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) jump</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="c">c) seem</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="d">d) eat</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-fb">✅ <b>seem</b> é um linking verb — conecta o sujeito a uma descrição!</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="b">
        <p>2. In "She <b>looks</b> happy", what is the linking verb?</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) She</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) looks</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="c">c) happy</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="d">d) None</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-fb">✅ <b>looks</b> conecta "She" ao adjetivo "happy"!</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="c">
        <p>3. Which sentence uses a <b>linking verb</b>?</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) He runs in the park.</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) She writes a letter.</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="c">c) The cake smells delicious.</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="d">d) They play soccer.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-fb">✅ <b>smells</b> liga "The cake" ao adjetivo "delicious"!</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="b">
        <p>4. Complete: "Peter _____ very frustrated in the story."</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) runs</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) feels</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="c">c) jumps</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="d">d) writes</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-fb">✅ <b>feels</b> é um linking verb que conecta Peter ao estado "frustrated"!</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="a">
        <p>5. What do linking verbs connect the subject to?</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) An adjective or noun</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) Another verb</div>
