  <!-- ELA_6 · Verbs and Verbals -->
  <div class="card" id="ela6">
    <div class="card-header">
      <div class="card-icon teal">🔠</div>
      <div>
        <div class="card-title">ELA 6 · Verbs and Verbals</div>
        <div class="card-sub">Unit 2 · Establishing the Writing Process</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="compare-grid">
      <div class="compare-card a">
        <strong>⚡ VERB — action word</strong>
        <span>I <b>RUN</b> every day.<br>She <b>READS</b> a book.<br><i>→ shows what someone DOES</i></span>
      </div>
      <div class="compare-card b">
        <strong>📌 VERBAL — from a verb, acts as noun</strong>
        <span><b>READING</b> is fun.<br><b>PLAYING</b> is exciting.<br><i>→ names an ACTIVITY (subject)</i></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-tip">🇧🇷 Verbals são palavras que <b>vêm de verbos</b>, mas funcionam como <b>substantivos</b> na frase. "Ler é divertido" → <b>Ler</b> é o sujeito!</div>

    <div class="tbl-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Tipo</th><th>Estrutura</th><th>Exemplo</th><th>Função</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><b>Gerund</b></td><td>verb + ing</td><td><b>Reading</b> is fun.</td><td>Subject (noun)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><b>Infinitive</b></td><td>to + verb</td><td>Peter likes <b>to help</b>.</td><td>Noun / adjective</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <ul class="examples">
      <li><b>Reading</b> is fun. <span class="pill pill-purple">verbal · subject</span></li>
      <li><b>Playing</b> soccer is exciting. <span class="pill pill-purple">verbal · subject</span></li>
      <li><b>Writing</b> is important. <span class="pill pill-purple">verbal · subject</span></li>
      <li>Peter likes <b>to help</b> his mom. <span class="pill pill-blue">infinitive</span></li>
      <li>She loves <b>to read</b> every night. <span class="pill pill-blue">infinitive</span></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="quiz-section">
      <h3>🎯 Quiz — Verbs and Verbals</h3>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="c">
        <p>1. In "<b>Swimming</b> is my favorite sport", what is the verbal?</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) is</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) my</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="c">c) Swimming</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="d">d) sport</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-fb">✅ <b>Swimming</b> — gerund usado como sujeito da frase!</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="b">
        <p>2. Which sentence uses a <b>verbal</b> (not a regular verb)?</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) She runs fast.</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) Cooking is delicious.</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="c">c) They play outside.</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="d">d) He reads every night.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-fb">✅ <b>Cooking</b> é um gerund (verbal) funcionando como sujeito!</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="c">
        <p>3. In "Peter likes <b>to help</b> his mom", "to help" is a(n):</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) action verb</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) linking verb</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="c">c) verbal (infinitive)</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="d">d) adjective</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-fb">✅ <b>to help</b> é um infinitivo — verbal que funciona como objeto!</div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-q" data-correct="a">
        <p>4. In "<b>Running</b> every day is healthy", what is RUNNING?</p>
        <div class="quiz-opts">
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="a">a) Verbal (gerund) — subject</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="b">b) Action verb</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="c">c) Linking verb</div>
          <div class="quiz-opt" data-opt="d">d) Adjective</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-fb">✅ <b>Running</b> é um gerund (verbal) funcionando como sujeito!</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="exercise">
      <h4>✏️ Verb ou Verbal?</h4>
      <div class="tbl-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Frase</th><th>Resposta</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><b>RUNNING</b> is good for your health.</td><td><span class="pill pill-purple">Verbal (gerund)</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td>She <b>RUNS</b> every morning.</td><td><span class="pill pill-blue">Verb (action)</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td><b>WRITING</b> stories is fun.</td><td><span class="pill pill-purple">Verbal (gerund)</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td>He <b>WRITES</b> stories.</td><td><span class="pill pill-blue">Verb (action)</span></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

